es the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the Simple Past tense to talk and report about actions and events that are finished.  <br><br> Remember, there are Regular and Irregular verbs.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We are impressed by your work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He said you asked a lot of questions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You sent the dish back to the kitchen.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Introducing an Opinion ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the following phrases to introduce your opinion to someone else: <br><br> <span class=\"italic\">I think ... <br>In my/our opinion ... <br>As far as I understand ... <br>From my point of view ... <br>I would ... <br>I think you could ... </span> ", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to replace", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take the place of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your dish is going to be replaced. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when working at a restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "procedure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a way of doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You followed the company's procedure. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to a T", "type": "name"}, {"content": "exactly; perfectly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They were followed to a T.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "on the house", "type": "name"}, {"content": "no charge; free ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This meal is on the house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "in no time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will be ready in no time! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "potential", "type": "name"}, {"content": "have an ability that could develop to make you very good at something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We believe you have the potential to be a great chef.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catch on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin to understand or realize something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You caught on very quickly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "learner", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who learns how to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are a quick learner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "means a lot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to show you appreciate something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thank you. That means a lot to me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the role card. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a role. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Create a short dialogue (6-7 lines) about the situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1</span>: You want a raise. Talk about actions and events that happened to prove you are a hard worker. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2</span>: Your employee wants a raise. They tell you why. Introduce your opinion. Share your opinion. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about actions and events in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I introduce an opinion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}]}